[47.352105, "o", "s"]
[47.823265, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[47.85492, "o", "8 data flows (arrows). Each one carries data from one element to another.\r\n\r\n   F1 chat message                              Customer -> Chat app\r\n   F2 UNTRUSTED: system prompt + chat           Chat app -> Model\r\n   F4 UNTRUSTED: retrieved articles       Knowledge base -> Model\r\n   F5 model output                                 Model -> Chat app\r\n   F10 answer                                   Chat app -> Customer\r\n   F15 ticket text                              Customer -> Ticketing system\r\n   F11a resolved tickets                Ticketing system -> Nightly import\r\n   F11b new articles                      Nightly import -> Knowledge base\r\n"]
[47.85973, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m02\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m02\u001b[00m$ "]
