[68.255565, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[68.287564, "o", "STRIDE per element: which of the six questions to ask each part (Threat Dragon's table)\r\n\r\n   S  Spoofing: pretending to be someone or something else\r\n   T  Tampering: changing data or code\r\n   R  Repudiation: denying an action, because nothing proves it\r\n   I  Information disclosure: data reaching someone who shouldn't see it\r\n   D  Denial of service: making it slow or unavailable\r\n   E  Elevation of privilege: doing more than you're allowed to\r\n\r\n   element                              type             S T R I D E\r\n   Customer                             external entity  S . R . . .\r\n   Chat app                             process          S T R I D E\r\n   Model                                process          S T R I D E\r\n   Ticketing system                     data store       . T R I D .\r\n   Nightly import                       process          S T R I D E\r\n   Knowledge base                       data store       . T R I D .\r\n   F1 chat message                      data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F2 UNTRUSTED: system prompt + chat   data flow        . T . I D .\r\n"]
[68.287694, "o", "   F4 UNTRUSTED: retrieved articles     data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F5 model output                      data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F10 answer                           data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F15 ticket text                      data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F11a resolved tickets                data flow        . T . I D .\r\n   F11b new articles                    data flow        . T . I D .\r\n"]
[68.292439, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m02\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m02\u001b[00m$ "]
